r": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01SwnzJztsiiB9sY4GMQ9UXs", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 10371, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_016okCh9WSgYCjdPeau8oDQC", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 10671, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016okCh9WSgYCjdPeau8oDQC", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10671, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016okCh9WSgYCjdPeau8oDQC", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 13660, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_014biRtoP9eqMjfJph8Hwiow", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 17660, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_014biRtoP9eqMjfJph8Hwiow", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17660, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014biRtoP9eqMjfJph8Hwiow", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17660, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_012shWgAWG6MNuXDKh5YU3ZV", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 17960, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_012shWgAWG6MNuXDKh5YU3ZV", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17960, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012shWgAWG6MNuXDKh5YU3ZV", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19371, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01LArjKQJnBjUEdgaVEnscrg", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19671, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01LArjKQJnBjUEdgaVEnscrg", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19671, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01LArjKQJnBjUEdgaVEnscrg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24540, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01WWqvwMHvfNtMsXf9nWxJ36", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After checkout-api v2.3.1 was deployed, it failed health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with a 18% error rate. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging. The SRE agent rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback stopped partway with an orchestrator error after us-east, so for a short time the regions ran different versions (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1). A second rollback succeeded. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure; look into the orchestrator error during the rollback; find out why v2.3.1 was promoted to production even though v2.3.1-rc was unhealthy in staging."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55140, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01WWqvwMHvfNtMsXf9nWxJ36", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55140, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01WWqvwMHvfNtMsXf9nWxJ36", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 56891, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01FoZziEkYNfJvn9bz3AoMhr", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57191, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01FoZziEkYNfJvn9bz3AoMhr", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57191, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01FoZziEkYNfJvn9bz3AoMhr", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62027, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened a SEV2 incident, INC-0001, describing what I did.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production, so I rolled back to it.\n  - The first attempt stopped partway with an orchestrator error. Only us-east had moved to v2.3.0, so for a short time the regions were on different versions.\n  - I checked the status and ran the same rollback again, and it worked. All regions are now on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The request to create INC-0001 timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't create it again and page on-call twice. The incident lists three follow-ups:\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 is failing.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 reached production even though its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy in staging.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01M3x2e83ZVmK2LnmQFt3Y5w", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01SiSomwvEWt4QWi5xZXQYrb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01SwnzJztsiiB9sY4GMQ9UXs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_016okCh9WSgYCjdPeau8oDQC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_014biRtoP9eqMjfJph8Hwiow", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012shWgAWG6MNuXDKh5YU3ZV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LArjKQJnBjUEdgaVEnscrg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01WWqvwMHvfNtMsXf9nWxJ36", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After checkout-api v2.3.1 was deployed, it failed health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with a 18% error rate. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging. The SRE agent rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback stopped partway with an orchestrator error after us-east, so for a short time the regions ran different versions (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1). A second rollback succeeded. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure; look into the orchestrator error during the rollback; find out why v2.3.1 was promoted to production even though v2.3.1-rc was unhealthy in staging."}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01FoZziEkYNfJvn9bz3AoMhr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened a SEV2 incident, INC-0001, describing what I did.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production, so I rolled back to it.\n  - The first attempt stopped partway with an orchestrator error. Only us-east had moved to v2.3.0, so for a short time the regions were on different versions.\n  - I checked the status and ran the same rollback again, and it worked. All regions are now on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The request to create INC-0001 timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't create it again and page on-call twice. The incident lists three follow-ups:\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 is failing.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 reached production even though its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy in staging.", "type": "text"}]}]}